<title>USA: Tennant to buy back up to 600,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Tennant to buy back up to 600,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tennant Co said Thursday its directors authorized the purchase of up to 600,000 shares of the company's 9,985,000 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Under the stock buyback program, purchases will be made from time to time in the open market or through privately negotiated transactions as the company may determine.</p>
<p>In other action, Tennant said its directors voted a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.18 be paid on June 13, to shareholders of record June 5.</p>
<p>Tennant makes non-residential floor maintenance equipment amd floor coatings.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
